# Only the web interface is published. Everything else stays local.
# This is a WHITELIST: anything not listed below is ignored and cannot be
# added by accident (Python automation, config, data, .env, supabase/ ...).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/js/
!/css/
!/img/

# Never publish these, even inside the whitelisted folders
.env
.env.*
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.map
